            "comprehends": [
             "copies/tx963yw9164#inscription"
            ],
            "note": "Graded high on the figures of the date: every figure is plain. Pencil, one line, lower panel upright. Five figures run together without separators, 15 2 24. The 1 and 5 are plain, the two middle figures are the same 2 with its flat base stroke, and the 4 is the open-top form. No roll number or name in this crop."
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       },
       "medium": "pencil"
      }
     ]
    }
